  "bodyHash": "ac1312d9634cc4ad",
  "content": "<h1>使物品堆疊數量達 64</h1>\n<p><strong>此模組讓一些原本無法堆疊的物品變得可以堆疊，並讓一些原本最多只能堆疊 16 個的物品變成最多可堆疊 64 個。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c60e34de98727d1808c395cb120db79ea9c2aabd.png\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22bc3b74a095f1860e0c826130a5b775016e49b3.png\" alt=\"line\"></p>\n<h3>藥水</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc0e615d6a78b7ad38a721ac913e536fbc5f7fe0.gif\" alt=\"Potion\"></p>\n<h3>不死图腾</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0224ab0656199be857586cb3c6595512a078dbbc.gif\" alt=\"totem\"></p>\n<h3>細雪</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d78504110aea359f9730b19160c678ed2ea335b0.gif\" alt=\"snow powder\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22bc3b74a095f1860e0c826130a5b775016e49b3.png\" alt=\"line\"></p>\n<h2>物品</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2a06cad9ca317672139d9e3d1ce431fde608095b.png\" alt=\"Items\"></p>\n<h2>馬鎧甲</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a87ca5cfa5f70e31e18c2c5ec3bab34bf973e631.png\" alt=\"horse\"></p>\n<h2>礦車</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/10f410bd6d92aafcea3fbafd3b880b9b1b1ccc1e.png\" alt=\"minecart\"></p>\n<h2>桶子</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/478842c9c46c3bbc95aa9c6cc22625e4c34ffc03.png\" alt=\"bucket\"></p>\n<h2>床</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12960476335205502281230ad8883de8bd1b108b.png\" alt=\"bed\"></p>\n<h2>藥水</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/33ccc8cb855c87fbd70e899f36e57676c8f4c14b.png\" alt=\"potion\"></p>\n<h2>旗幟</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0ad6c815a598cd54511219449f6ab194502030a.png\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<h2>船</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/960b0757e43eae00a9609d6bb262ca4d4f4e5249.png\" alt=\"Boat\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>更新</h1>\n<h2>棕色蛋與藍色蛋</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aee1e3b67d0dd999e761e28b827d02f72e55094e.png\" alt=\"eggs\"></p>\n<h2>鸚鵡螺甲冑</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/878cc1d73b6d2fa45e7f94fbc005e09985206a35.png\" alt=\"nautilus\"></p>",
